1
00:00:09,980 --> 00:00:11,360
我们要用电视机了!
We need the TV,Mike.

2
00:00:11,690 --> 00:00:13,490
我正在看电视剧呢!
Can't you see I'm in the middle of a show here.

3
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:17,260
我有比这更好看的。
Yeah,well,I got a better show.

4
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:20,740
