Why?

6
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:25,520
那会很在意思的。
Well,this ought to be fun.

7
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:26,960
快点，Ben。
Hurry up,Ben.

8
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:28,160
来前排。
Front row.

9
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:29,950
爸爸，你是想让我献丑吗？
Dad,you are embarrassing me.

10
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:32,460
不是挺有意思的吗？
What? You're not excited about seeing yourself in diapers ...

11
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:33,780
看看你自己包着尿布流着口水的样子
with drool running down your chin?

12
00:00:35,720 --> 00:00:37,780
呵呵，他的样子只要照一下镜子就能看到。
He can just look in the mirror to see that.

13
00:00:38,170 --> 00:00:41,620
噢，Mike小时候是个漂亮活泼的孩子。
Oh,Mike was such a cute little baby.

14
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:43,640
行了，我现在要去温课了。
Alright. Look,I have to go to study,OK?

15
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:45,700
我从没听你说过温课。
What's the matter,there's a full moon?

16
00:00:45,810 --> 00:00:50,740
呃，真对不起我不能和你们一起分享家庭的欢乐。
Yeah,I am really very sorry I'm going to miss out on all this family fun.

17
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:53,020
不过，当然，也希望能和你们一起来看，
Gee I do really love it too.

18
00:00:53,060 --> 00:00:55,900
我们在一起像好朋友，可是我……
You know when we pal around like this.But hey,I have to stu....

19
00:00:56,440 --> 00:00:59,660
Mike，你妈妈花了很大精力来翻录。
your mother has gone to a lot of trouble putting these films on tape.

20
00:00:59,660 --> 00:01:01,560
算了，既然他不愿意看……
It's OK. If he doesn't want to see them.

21
00:01:01,960 --> 00:01:02,800
他想看。
He does.

22
00:01:03,220 --> 00:01:05,120
爸爸，你是说我不用去温课了？
Dad,you are suggesting that I shouldn't study?

23
00:01:05,660 --> 00:01:09,000
是的，是这样的。你温课的时间实在是太多了
Yes,I am. Mike,I think you are spending far too much time studying

24
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:11,740
而傻乎乎地盯着电视看的时间太少。
and too little time staring blankly at the TV.

25
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:16,240
Ben，我可不想再等你了。就先放你的带子了。
Ben,we are not waiting for you,your tape is first.

26
00:01:16,340 --> 00:01:18,480
我来了我来了我来了。
Let's go,let's go,let's go!

27
00:01:20,060 --> 00:01:22,020
