Here we go!

30
00:01:28,620 --> 00:01:32,460
你刚才说先放我？这可是Mike。
Hey. You said the first tape was me,this is Mike.

31
00:01:37,020 --> 00:01:39,400
噢！Mike看上去就像一小段香肠。
Gee,Mike,you sure look like a lady.

32
00:01:39,630 --> 00:01:42,180
