Well,this sure cuts into my fun.,and how about you,Maggie?

35
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:53,220
对，让Mike献丑就是我翻录像带的主要原因之一，
Yes,humiliating Mike was one reason I had these movies transferred.

36
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:56,880
