那么五年的钢琴课就算没有白上。
just so 5 years of piano lessons don't go down the drain.

39
00:02:03,420 --> 00:02:06,040
好吧好吧好吧，你们这种兴致可真要我的命。
All right,look,I know this family fun is going to kill me.

40
00:02:06,900 --> 00:02:08,760
