104
00:07:33,340 --> 00:07:37,960
我很高兴你和爸爸说过要去斯丁其家。
I'm glad you told your father that you were going to Stinkey's. but your father

105
00:07:37,960 --> 00:07:39,780
可你爸爸不知道我要你整理自己的房间。
doesn't know that I wanted you to clean your room this morning.

106
