I turned my ankle.

173
00:11:14,350 --> 00:11:18,610
我早知道打得太久了，做父母的就是不听话。
Look,I knew you couldn't play too long. You know parents never listen.

174
00:11:19,060 --> 00:11:21,590
你用不着来唬我，让我歇一会就会好的。
No,I'm fine. All right. Just give me a minute,I can walk it off.

175
00:11:21,590 --> 00:11:27,240
我说爸爸，我累得一秒钟都坚持不了，别玩了。
Hey look dad,I am really bushed. I couldn't play another second. I…

