Don't worry,dad. I'll take care of you.

183
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:04,860
Ben，你在这干嘛？
Ben,what are you doing here?

184
00:12:05,100 --> 00:12:05,580
这是我的家！
I live here.

185
00:12:05,580 --> 00:12:08,770
这会你该带爸爸出去才是！
You're supposed to have dad out of the house by now?

186
00:12:09,420 --> 00:12:12,300
你要我怎么办？总不能不让爸爸上厕所！
What do you want from me? The man has to go to the bathroom.

187
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:15,940
Ben，爸爸呢？
Ben,where's your dad?

188
00:12:16,380 --> 00:12:17,660
大概在厕所里。
In the bathroom I hope.

189
00:12:21,880 --> 00:12:23,480
这照片怎么样，Ben？
So what do you think,Ben?

190
00:12:25,200 --> 00:12:27,840
我认为这玩意会使他心情更不好。
I think this is going to make him even more depressed

191
00:12:29,240 --> 00:12:33,540
不，你爸爸一看到这张照片马上就会恢复这种情形
Oh,no. Ben. Once he starts to play rock and roll,he's going to start to feel like this again.

192
00:12:34,120 --> 00:12:34,940
