Where do you want to stash this thing until the party?

195
00:12:38,980 --> 00:12:41,700
放厨房。我试图让你爸爸从大门出去。
OK,in the kitchen. I'll have your father go out the front door.

196
00:12:48,980 --> 00:12:50,060
