I'll get it.

197
00:12:50,060 --> 00:12:52,560
我是戴夫·萨克斯，专门代客人去办聚会。
I'm David Sax from party animal party rentals.

198
00:12:52,560 --> 00:12:54,300
来得太早了。
You are early.

199
00:12:55,140 --> 00:12:56,080
赶早不赶迟。
That's our policy.

200
00:12:56,720 --> 00:12:57,180
不！
No.

201
00:12:57,400 --> 00:12:58,100
我没说错。
Yes,it is.

202
00:12:59,080 --> 00:13:02,230
不，我是想说，让爸爸惊喜一下，可他现在没离家。
No. It's supposed to be a surprise for my dad and my dad is still here.

203
00:13:03,240 --> 00:13:03,460
无赖？
Bummer.

204
00:13:04,720 --> 00:13:05,500
走吧，Ben。
Let's go,Ben.

205
00:13:05,540 --> 00:13:06,920
啊，我明白了。
No,maybe I can…

206
00:13:08,200 --> 00:13:11,340
Ben，去动物园可是你的主意，咱们走吧。
Come on,Ben. This is your idea to go to the zoo,let's go!

207
00:13:11,340 --> 00:13:15,400
今天一定很带劲，我要在蛇馆里呆他个一整天。
This is going to be great. I want to spend the whole day at the snake house.

208
00:13:16,200 --> 00:13:16,920
你们谁都不想去？
Anybody else want to come?

209
00:13:17,620 --> 00:13:19,130
