No,I've got things to do.

210
00:13:19,130 --> 00:13:20,000
Carol?

211
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:24,240
噢，我是多么喜欢看笼子里的那些飞禽走兽，可是
Oh,no. Darn it! You know how I love to see Gods creatures in cages,but ..

212
00:13:24,840 --> 00:13:26,660
我得温课。
I have to study.

213
00:13:28,320 --> 00:13:29,260
快走。
Let's roll!

214
00:13:31,220 --> 00:13:33,000
不！你们从厨房出去。
No,you have to go to the kitchen.

215
00:13:33,880 --> 00:13:34,360
不！
No!

216
00:13:34,640 --> 00:13:35,820
