Well so is the porch.

218
00:13:36,980 --> 00:13:37,290
Carol.

219
00:13:37,290 --> 00:13:37,390
Carol？

220
00:13:37,390 --> 00:13:38,380
妈妈你看……
Mom.

221
00:13:42,720 --> 00:13:46,000
看来出路都断绝了。Ben，我们只好呆在家里。
Well,apparently there's no way out,Ben,I guess we'll have to stay here.

222
00:13:46,220 --> 00:13:46,680
不。
No!

223
00:13:48,100 --> 00:13:49,480
究竟是怎么回事？
What's going on here?

224
00:13:49,840 --> 00:13:51,000
噢，我知道了。
Oh,I know.

225
00:13:51,540 --> 00:13:55,060
现在地上可能已经干了，你们就从厨房出去吧Jason！
The kitchen floor is probably dry by now. If you go out that way,Jason.

226
00:13:56,700 --> 00:13:57,760
谢谢你maggie！
Thanks Maggie!

227
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:05,760
好了，你们就从厨房出去吧。
So,the kitchen,it is then.

228
00:14:08,620 --> 00:14:14,480
今天你们可解放了。
Are you four all right?

229
00:14:15,580 --> 00:14:16,760
Mike，那是什么？
Mike,what's this?

230
00:14:17,300 --> 00:14:18,160
