What's the mess you are making?

232
00:14:21,880 --> 00:14:26,970
呃，你所讲的乱乱七八糟其实就是我的美术课作业，
This mess as you call it,just happens to be my project for art class.

233
00:14:26,970 --> 00:14:30,330
题目是你要放洋葱我就杀了你。
I can't hold the onions or I'll kill you.

234
00:14:31,200 --> 00:14:33,800
我们走。我们走！
Let's go,let's go,let's go!

235
