261
00:15:52,620 --> 00:15:55,780
我还从来没在这么高级的场合演出过呢。
The Wild Hots never played in a place this classic before.

262
00:15:56,440 --> 00:15:59,500
孩子们，这是维克。维克，这是Carol和Mike。
Kids,this is Rick. Rick,this is Carol and Mike.

263
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:00,240
嗨。
Hi!

264
00:16:10,280 --> 00:16:11,660
Maggie，哈哈。有件事Maggie，
Oh. Maggie. By the way,Maggie.

265
00:16:11,660 --> 00:16:14,180
