Warren said he'd be here.

268
00:16:17,210 --> 00:16:20,980
可他被冠心病折腾了一下。
Well,he's had a little coronary.

269
00:16:22,060 --> 00:16:22,850
天啊。
Oh dear!

270
00:16:22,850 --> 00:16:24,910
情况不严重，睡上个把星期就好了。
Nothing serious. He's going to be up in about a week or so.

271
