Wait a minute. Mike can fill in on keyboards.

272
00:16:28,480 --> 00:16:31,770
不行，我一点也没有研究过，那种老派.破烂….
Hay,Mom. I don't know those stupid,fol....

273
00:16:33,860 --> 00:16:34,440
经典的音乐
classics.

274
