不，要是你识五线谱就比我们高明得多了。
If you know five chords then you know two more than we do.

275
00:17:16,600 --> 00:17:17,930
挺浪漫。
Radical?

276
00:17:17,930 --> 00:17:24,740
妈妈，这样闹下去很可能爸爸会去跳河自杀。
Mom,I think we go through with this,there's a good chance that dad is going to drown himself.

277
00:17:24,740 --> 00:17:26,910
有这么严重吗？
No,I don't think it sounded that bad

278
00:17:26,910 --> 00:17:30,070
Maggie，有阿斯匹林吗？
Maggie,do you have any aspirin?

279
00:17:33,720 --> 00:17:35,430
我保留我的意见。
I rest my case!

280
00:17:35,430 --> 00:17:38,520
好吧,好吧你说得对。可你让我怎么办，
Ok,Mike. You're right,but what am I supposed to do?

281
00:17:39,200 --> 00:17:40,850
难道让我把客人们都撵走吗？
I can't just throw all these people out.

282
00:17:40,850 --> 00:17:43,190
好，你听着，咱们会有办法的
I don't know mom,but we can handle this.

283
00:17:44,040 --> 00:17:45,740
我到厨房里放把火。
I can set the kitchen on fire.

284
00:17:47,560 --> 00:17:49,080
不行，我舍不得厨房。
No,I like the kitchen.

285
00:17:49,080 --> 00:17:51,400
好了算了,算了，那爸爸的办公室。
Oh,I know. How about dad's office?

286
00:17:51,800 --> 00:17:53,540
听我说，还是让我来处理吧。
No,it's OK. I'll handle this.

287
00:17:53,670 --> 00:18:04,450
