297
00:18:42,820 --> 00:18:47,780
女士们先生们，野性热情的创始人魔王Jason Seaver！
Ladies and gentlemen,. The founder of Wild Hots Jammins Jason Seavor

298
00:18:49,010 --> 00:18:53,540
