This is great,oh,where's Warren?

301
00:19:01,180 --> 00:19:04,260
他？他心脏病发了。呵呵。
Oh,he had a… he had a heart attack.

302
00:19:04,360 --> 00:19:06,290
什么？
What?

303
00:19:06,290 --> 00:19:07,130
