He's thirty-eight years old.

305
00:19:10,760 --> 00:19:12,780
对，他终于懂得了不能和小伙子相比。
I guess he's finally learned that he can't keep up with the youngsters.

306
00:19:13,780 --> 00:19:15,740
对不起Jason，能和你谈一分钟吗？
Excuse me,Jason,can I talk with you for a minute?

307
00:19:16,820 --> 00:19:17,920
最好简短一点。
Better make it quick.

308
00:19:29,380 --> 00:19:31,600
你相信吗？38岁心脏病就要发作。
Can you imagine that? A heart attack at thirty eight!

309
00:19:32,640 --> 00:19:35,540
亲爱的，我的计划是不知道这个情况的。
Oh,honey,I had no idea when I planned this.

310
00:19:37,320 --> 00:19:39,080
那么，历克的脑壳呢？
What about Rick's crone dome?

311
00:19:39,660 --> 00:19:41,700
脱发早的人也是常见的。
Well,a lot of men lose their hair early.

312
00:19:42,280 --> 00:19:45,080
对，尤其是在核电站工作的人。
Yeah,if they had nuclear waste in their shorts!

313
00:19:46,860 --> 00:19:49,320
我组织这个聚会绝不是想让你难过。
The last thing I wanted to do with this party is depress you.

314
00:19:49,600 --> 00:19:50,240
