But would I listen? No.

327
00:20:30,480 --> 00:20:32,860
老兄，我们已经排了一遍了，立刻要上演了，
Hey Dude. We knocked the rust off the edges and we are really cooking

328
00:20:32,860 --> 00:20:34,460
