332
00:20:44,020 --> 00:20:46,740
Let's take those old records off the shelf.

333
00:20:47,740 --> 00:20:50,520
Sit and listen to them by myself.

334
00:20:51,700 --> 00:20:54,600
Today's music ain't got the same soul

335
00:20:54,940 --> 00:20:58,420
as that old time rock and roll,

336
00:20:58,420 --> 00:21:02,420
Call me a rebel call me what you will.

337
00:21:02,420 --> 00:21:05,740
Say I'm old fashioned say I'm over the hill.

338
00:21:05,740 --> 00:21:09,820
Today's music ain't got the same soul

339
00:21:09,820 --> 00:21:12,710
as that old time rock and roll.

340
00:21:12,710 --> 00:21:16,410
I love that old time rock and roll.

341
00:21:16,410 --> 00:21:20,350
That kind of music does soothe my soul.

